  id: spell-web
  displayName: Web
  description: Thick, sticky webbing fills a 20-foot cube within range for up to 1 hour (concentration). Each creature that starts its turn in the webs, or enters them, must make a Dexterity saving throw or become restrained as long as it remains in the webs (a Strength check against your spell save DC frees it early -- escape not modeled). Difficult terrain/light obscurement/flammability not modeled. Restrained condition applied with an indefinite duration -- no auto-removal on escape or on the spell ending yet, see file header.
